sequenceDiagram
    participant Device as Peripheral Device
    participant Central as Central Scan Handler
    participant Validator as RTC Sync Validator
    participant Scheduler as Smart Scheduler
    participant Allocator as Slot Allocator
    
    Note over Device: 📱 设备注册和智能时隙分配流程
    
    Device->>Central: Registration Request<br/>(message_type=0x20)
    Note right of Device: device_id, phy_type<br/>rtc_time, sync_confidence
    
    Central->>Validator: validate_rtc_sync(request)
    Validator->>Validator: Check sync_confidence >= 150
    Validator->>Validator: Calculate time difference
    
    alt RTC Sync Valid
        Validator-->>Central: ✅ Validation passed
        Central->>Scheduler: find_optimal_timeslot()
        
        Note over Scheduler: 🎯 Smart timeslot selection
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Determine PHY range<br/>(1M: 10-29, Coded: 30-49)
        
        loop For each available slot
            Scheduler->>Allocator: calculate_timeslot_score()
            Allocator-->>Scheduler: Slot quality score
        end
        
        Scheduler-->>Central: Best slot identified
        
        Central->>Allocator: add_active_slot(slot)
        Allocator->>Allocator: calculate_neighbor_interference()
        Allocator-->>Central: Active slot configured
        
        Central->>Central: Register device<br/>Update counters
        Central-->>Device: ✅ Registration successful
        
    else RTC Sync Invalid
        Validator-->>Central: ❌ Validation failed
        Central-->>Device: ❌ Registration rejected
    end